  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For a given speed,</p><p>the maximum range of a projectile on a horizontal level is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>g</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>the maximum range up and down the incline are</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>up</mi></msub></mfenced><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>down</mi></msub></mfenced><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>by substituting the values of the velocities given in the problem, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>g</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br />Now, <math><msub><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>g</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math></p>"
  }
